.TH PERFECTSENSED 8 "2026-09-09" "PerfectSense 0.0.17" "System Management"
.SH NAME
perfectsensed \- PerfectSense system daemon (org.perfectsense.Sense1)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perfectsensed
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B perfectsensed
is a root
.B systemd
service that exports
.B org.perfectsense.Sense1
on the system bus.
It mirrors PerfectSense sysfs state as D\-Bus properties and methods, runs
FanAggressor
.B only
while offset mode is enabled, and translates kernel hotkey/AC uevents into the
.B Hotkey
signal.
.PP
Hardware keys are handled in the kernel module as input events plus uevents
with
.B PERFECTSENSE_EVENT
/
.B PERFECTSENSE_KEY .
The daemon:
.IP \(bu 2
emits
.BI Hotkey "(s event, u key)"
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B mode
cycles thermal profiles
.RB ( low\-power
\(->
.BR quiet
\(->
.BR balanced
\(->
.BR balanced\-performance
\(->
.BR performance ),
skipping profiles rejected by firmware (e.g. on battery)
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B turbo
(AC only) toggles the CPU power preset
.B turbo
with platform profile sync; a second press restores the CPU snapshot
and returns thermal to
.B balanced
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B ac\-offline
demotes
.BR quiet ,
.BR balanced\-performance ,
or
.B performance
to
.B balanced
(and drops a latched CPU turbo governor); remembers the prior profile
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B ac\-online
restores that remembered profile when possible
.PP
Debug injection:
.B perfectsense event inject
.IR turbo|mode|ac\-offline|ac\-online
or D\-Bus
.BR InjectEvent .
.SH PROPERTIES
Thermal/fans/CPU plus misc parity with sysfs/CLI, including writable
.BR BatteryLimiter ,
.BR BatteryCalibration ,
.BR UsbCharging ,
.BR LcdOverride ,
.BR BacklightTimeout ,
.BR BootAnimationSound ,
.BR NvidiaPowerd ,
and read-only
.BR TempCpu ,
.BR TempGpu ,
.BR FanRpmCpu ,
.BR FanRpmGpu ,
.BR RgbEffect .
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B ProfileChanged (s)
Thermal profile name changed.
.TP
.B FanAggressorChanged (b)
FanAggressor enable flag changed.
.TP
.B Hotkey (su)
Firmware/key event name and numeric key code from the module.
.SH METHODS
.TP
.B SetFanTarget (uu) / SetFanAuto
Manual fan duties or firmware auto.
.TP
.B SetRgb (s) / SetRgbEffect (s) / SetLogo (s) / LightingReset
Keyboard and lid lighting.
.TP
.B InjectEvent (s)
Write sysfs
.B inject_event
(same names as the CLI).
.TP
.B Refresh
Emit property-changed notifications for the Sense1 surface.
.TP
.B CpuPreset (sb) / CpuRestore
Userspace CPU power presets.
.TP
.B FanAggressorStatus / FanAggressorReload
Query runtime status; re-read
.I /etc/perfectsense/fan-aggressor.conf
and
.I /run/perfectsense/fan-aggressor.conf
and re-arm or stop the offset timer without restarting the daemon.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/system/perfectsensed.service
Unit file (also
.BR perfectsensed.path ).
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus\-1/system.d/org.perfectsense.Sense1.conf
D\-Bus policy.
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus\-1/interfaces/org.perfectsense.Sense1.xml
Introspection XML.
.TP
.I /run/perfectsense/
Runtime directory (FanAggressor config).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR perfectsense (1),
.BR systemd.service (5),
.BR busctl (1)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yPerfectBR/PerfectSense
